  today  uh for two ben sudai in her statement  also said  that she will decide on the priorities  in the coming  weeks also given you know the challenges  uh by the pandemic  and also the workload of the office of  the prosecutor  yeah you bring up a good point too the  list of possibilities there is is very  long  we know that the israeli prime minister  benjamin netanyahu he has called this  decision anti-semitic  and absurd what can he do now  well that is a good question of course  israel also has now period of time  to answer to this opening of the  investigation but  the reaction by the israeli prime  minister  doesn't come as a surprise already last  month he had called that decision by the  judges  by the icc as anti-semitic this has been  a long-held view  by israel that the court is overstepping  its mandate and that this  is a highly politicized politicized  issue and that the court  actually doesn't have uh jurisdiction  now we also have to mention this is kind  of a consensus in israeli politics we  heard from several other  political leaders tonight being highly  critical  of this decision by the icc not by all  parties but by most  i have to mention that because we're  also in the middle of an election  campaign there are elections in three  weeks and  some of his political rivals will  certainly use this against mr netanyahu  because it happened on his watch  but again this is a decision that will  go beyond a party politics and beyond  this election this will keep  israeli politics busy for years to come  so on the palestinian side of course  this decision was warmly welcomed we had  a statement from the foreign ministry  saying that this will lead to  accountability  and justice and you have to say the  palestinians have been working  very diligently on this issue to  internationalize to go and join  international organizations  and so they hope that some somehow  israel will held accountable for what it  does here in this conflict  okay dw's tonya kramer with the latest  tonight in jerusalem tanya as always  thank you
 

